cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "robust-classification: replication package for RoLLR and S-RoLLR"
abstract: >-
  R and Rcpp implementation of the RoLLR and S-RoLLR classifiers, which model
  each class-conditional feature marginal with the two-piece scale-Cauchy (TPSC)
  family, transform features by the fitted log-likelihood ratio, and classify
  with L1-penalized logistic regression. Includes the full simulation study,
  three real-data case studies, the stage-1 estimation lab, and the
  working-distribution extension experiments reported in the manuscript.
type: software
license: MIT
